Package: infostop
Title: R Interface to the Python 'infostop' Package for Detecting Stop Locations in Mobility Data
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Florian",
           family = "Schwendinger",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "Florian.Schwendinger@quintik.at")
Description: An R wrapper for the Python 'infostop' package which implements 
    algorithms for detecting stop locations in time-ordered location data. 
    The package is useful for anyone who wishes to detect stationary events in 
    location coordinate streams, simplifying dense and rich location time-series 
    into sequences of events. The underlying algorithm is described in 
    Aslak et al. (2020) <arXiv:2003.14370>.
